description = Color(As a lawyer, [PAWN_nameDef] could convict a deaf man for stealing music. [PAWN_possessive] sharp mind and lack of empathy let [PAWN_objective] say anything to get the other person to talk. With the right amount of money, [PAWN_pronoun] knew, any case can be won.\n\n[PAWN_possessive] childhood cough never went away.)
